OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy, with patchy rain
OL,6,Fat first in the west. Cloud will break
OL,7,Fin the east during the afternoon with
OL,8,Fsunny spells, but becoming cloudy
OL,9,Fagain overnight. Turning increasingly
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy at first with breaks
OL,13,Fin the cloud develop in the east
OL,14,Fduring the day with sunny spells.
OL,15,FOvernight feeling cold with frost
OL,16,Flikely under clear skies and light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
