OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy in the west and
OL,6,Fclear skies in the east, for much of
OL,7,Fthe day before turning cloudy
OL,8,Fovernight but remaining dry. Winds
OL,9,Fgenerally light but breezy along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FGenerally cloudy and dry on Thursday.
OL,14,FFriday and Saturday turn increasingly
OL,15,Fwetter and unsettled with rain
OL,16,Fbecoming heavy on Sunday. Feeling
OL,17,Fchilly away from the coast, with
OL,18,Ftemperatures below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
